  "question": {
    "html": "<p>X and Y are two spherical black-body radiators. X has a radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> and emits half the total power of Y. The absolute temperature of X is double that of Y.</p>\n<p>What is the radius of Y?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{2R}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4R\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\sqrt{2R}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16R\"></span></li></ol>"
